"""
Opinion Volume Bot v7.1 (Smart Adoption & Partial Fill Support)
===============================================================
LOGIC UPDATE:
1. No Blind Cancel: '/sellall' NO LONGER cancels orders upon start. It simply enables management.
2. Order Adoption: The bot checks for existing orders.
   - If an order exists AND price is Best Ask -> IT HOLDS IT. (Preserves Queue Priority & Partial Fills)
   - If price is pushed -> Cancels & Replaces.
3. Fallback Safety: Only if 'place_order' fails with 'Insufficient Balance' does it trigger a force unlock.
"""

